[00:08.910]You know the bed feels warmer
{"你明白独自躺在这床上更温暖"}
[00:11.470]Sleeping here alone
{"独自安睡于此"}
[00:15.350]You know I dream in colour
{"你知晓我的梦境五彩斑斓"}
[00:19.830]And do the things I want
{"随心所欲做我所想"}
[00:23.870]You think you got the best of me
